57bm-i12"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-i12"],"id":"long.record-257bm-i12","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.103 (A division-free form of the binary bound)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.103, p. 73, label record:257bm-i12","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For $M\\ge0$ and $d\\ge2$,\n$$\n\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2^M}{2^d-1}\\right\\rfloor\n   =\\sum_{j=1}^{\\lfloor M/d\\rfloor}2^{M-jd},\n$$\nwhere an empty sum is zero. To see this, write $M=qd+r$ with $0\\le r<d$ and expand the finite geometric sum. The remaining fraction is $2^r/(2^d-1)$, which lies strictly between $0$ and $1$. Substitution in Theorem 6.93 expresses its quotient condition as a finite sum of powers of $2$. This is an exact rewriting, not a weaker hypothesis or a new existence result.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.record-257bm-i12","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.record-257bm-i12","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i12%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.localBinarySuffix_two_mul_sub_two_lt_criticalCapacity_iff_geometric%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i12%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.localBinarySuffix_two_mul_sub_two_lt_criticalCapacity_iff_geometric%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.localBinarySuffix_two_mul_sub_two_lt_criticalCapacity_iff_geometric"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.record-257bm-i12","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0d